00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:10.800
(SOCCER, ISLAM AND MILITARY PRESSURES)
 
In May 1971, the Turkish armed forces&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:14.460
issued an ultimatum to the conservative&nbsp;
government of Süleyman Demirel and,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:17.520
in general, to all political parties. The&nbsp;
military demanded that the politicians&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:21.420
contain the growing religious extremism that&nbsp;
was bringing chaos to the republican order.
 &nbsp;

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:25.500
This situation worsened after the onset of&nbsp;
a severe economic crisis, caused in large&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:29.160
part by strong trade protectionism.
 
The fact is that this crisis resulted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:32.640
in high levels of unemployment – over&nbsp;
20% – and out-of-control inflation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:39.540
for example, while annual inflation was 15.4%&nbsp;
in 1972, by 1980 it was already over 94%.
 &nbsp;

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:44.040
Well, at that time, the government ordered the&nbsp;
illegalization of several parties for being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:48.900
against secularization, that is to say, against&nbsp;
the model of a non-denominational State. Among&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:54.600
these banned formations was the National Order&nbsp;
Party (MNP) in which Erdoğan was a militant.
 &nbsp;

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:58.680
However, the following year, the leader&nbsp;
of this party, Necmettin Erbakan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:02.280
registered another similar grouping under&nbsp;
the name of the National Salvation Party&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:07.080
(MSP). Remember this name because it will be&nbsp;
key in the future of the still young Recep.
 &nbsp;

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:10.860
VisualPolitik viewers, the turbulent&nbsp;
1970s finally ended with a coup d'état&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:15.960
in 1980. That year the military junta
ed by General Kenan Evren ceased democratic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:19.860
institutions, extended martial law, banned&nbsp;
all political parties and imprisoned and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:24.300
tried tens of thousands of political activists.
 
During this time, with politics firmly shut down,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:28.440
Erdogan explored other fields. For example, he&nbsp;
tried his luck as a semi-professional footballer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:31.200
and managed to earn a university&nbsp;
degree in business administration.&nbsp;

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:39.420
The fact is that in 1983, under the cover of&nbsp;
the military's new permissive legislation, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:44.580
National Salvation Party was refounded into the&nbsp;
Welfare Party and under Erbakan's command, Erdoğan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:49.680
once again jumped back into political life.
 
His big break would come in 1984. That year a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:53.100
democratically elected government returned&nbsp;
to power. And just then, Erdoğan began to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:57.060
