He was appointed coordinator of the Welfare&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.060 --> 00:07:00.960
Party in Istanbul province. His name,&nbsp;
little by little, began to be popular:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:05.100
he represented the only Islamist force with&nbsp;
