00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:12.480
And so, in 1994, with 25.2% of&nbsp;
the vote, Erdoğan became the new&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:15.900
mayor of Istanbul. Keep in mind that&nbsp;
this was an absolutely key moment.
 &nbsp;

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:19.500
An Islamist party had taken control of the&nbsp;
main city in all of Turkey. The question&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:23.160
the country was asking itself was: What&nbsp;
would this government look like? Would the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:26.820
Islamists put an end to secularism? Could&nbsp;
they end up provoking a new coup d'état?
 &nbsp;

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:30.840
Well... The truth is that Erdoğan knew how to&nbsp;
play his cards. It was the perfect occasion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:33.480
to show that his Islamist party&nbsp;
could be a force of majorities.
 &nbsp;

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:41.760
And, as we say around here, no sooner said than&nbsp;
done. To the surprise of many, this mayor gave&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:45.420
preference to management over religion.
 
For example, he promoted a plan of public&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:48.720
works and new technologies to solve the&nbsp;
problems that existed in the water service,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.720 --> 00:07:51.720
in the congested road network and&nbsp;
in the waste system. Infrastructure&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:55.380
and public works were clearly his hallmark&nbsp;
and his springboard to national politics.
 &nbsp;

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:59.340
Suddenly, the Welfare Party seemed to have&nbsp;
put aside its Islamist agenda to become the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:02.160
standard bearer of modernization&nbsp;
in the cities... And guess what?

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:06.060
In 1995 this evolution allowed them&nbsp;
to become the most voted force at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:07.980
national level in the general elections...However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:11.820
they were unable to form a government.
 
The military opposed them head-on,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:15.960
