the slightest in running national politics.
 &nbsp;

00:08:23.340 --> 00:08:28.620
However, this pact lasted barely a year,&nbsp;
and on 28 June 1996, Necmettin Erbakan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:31.860
the founder of the country's only major&nbsp;
Islamist political force, succeeded in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:35.340
